<title>POLAND: BANK GDANSKI AUG NET FALLS TO PLN 1.1 MLN.</title>
<headline>BANK GDANSKI AUG NET FALLS TO PLN 1.1 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results August</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>AUGUST</p>
<p> Net profit					  1.09 vs    6.93</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				    2.20 vs   12.93</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		 23.58 vs   30.24</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues	63.05 vs   57.42</p>
<p>JANUARY-AUGUST</p>
<p> Net profit					 63.69 vs   78.42</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				  105.57 vs  146.46</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		255.03 vs  228.76</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues     483.73 vs  418.61</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish bank is Bank Gdanski SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
